{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國天團防彈少年團（BTS）於上周四、昨晚及今晚在台灣高雄國家體育場舉行3場演唱會，他們昨晚進行第二晚演出，有台媒指昨晚場內外人數最高達10.5萬人，超越2024年英國歌手Ed Sheeran演唱會創下的9萬4,636人的紀錄，創下世運主場</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T04:22:56.979881+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:04:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T04:16:20.420102+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T04:16:20.420102+00:00","content_hash":"3b45c7d4b9f29615fcfb12c27f068b2c65fc117fe7256658b015c62ababbd974","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}